          <th align="center" valign="top" style="padding-top:24px;width:670px;">

            <center style="min-width:0!important;width:100%"><!-- BEGIN EMAIL BODY --><table role="presentation" align="center" bgcolor="#262626" border="0" class="container" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="670">
                <tbody>
                  <tr>
                    <th><!-- START HEADER --><table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%">
                        <tr>
                          <th class="small-12 columns pad-bottom-24" style="padding-left:80px;padding-top:40px;text-align:left;width:100%"><img src="https://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{1ea7a4b0-77fb-4bf8-8fca-195a2ccec135}_347x108-Intel-IPA-logo.png" alt="" style="display:block;height:54px;width:174px;" height="54" valign="top" width="174"></th>
                        </tr>
                      </table>
                      <table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%">
                        <tbody>
                          <tr>
                            <th class="small-12 columns" style="padding-left:80px;padding-right:80px;width:510px;">
                              <table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="middle" width="100%">
                                <tr>
                                  <th class="small-12" style="width:210px;" valign="bottom">
                                    <table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="show-for-large" valign="top" width="100%">
                                      <tbody>
                                        <tr>
                                          <th style="line-height:24px;font-size:24px;" height="24">&nbsp;</th>
                                        </tr>
                                      </tbody>
                                    </table><img src="https://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{9fe13c0f-6051-4353-9666-41b69885ff6c}_hero_%281%29.jpg" alt="" class="responsive" style="display:block;height:210px;width:210px;" height="210" valign="top" width="210"></th>
                                  <th class="small-12 columns" style="background:#000000;width:310px;" valign="middle">
                                    <table role="presentation" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="collapse" width="100%">
                                      <tbody>
                                        <tr>
                                          <th class="small-12 columns pad-bottom-24 pad-top-24" style="padding:24px;">
                                            <h1 style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:25px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:32px;margin:0;margin-bottom:24.5px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Developer Zone Premier의 가치와 더불어 추가 혜택을 누려 보십시오!</h1>
                                            <table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%">
                                              <tr>
                                                <th style="min-width:200px;"><!-- START BUTTON --><table role="presentation" align="left" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="auto">
                                                    <tbody>
                                                      <tr>
                                                        <th style="background:#ffffff;padding:10px 24px 10px 24px;"><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/kr/ko/secure/forms/ipa-secondary.html" target="_blank" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#006ABB;display:block;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:20px;margin:0;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">인텔&reg; 파트너 얼라이언스 가입하기<img src="https://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{d10a0171-9566-461e-b39d-83894db2af31}_arrow_email_blue.png" valign="middle" alt=""></a></th>
                                                      </tr>
                                                    </tbody>
                                                  </table><!-- END BUTTON --></th>
                                              </tr>
                                            </table>

                                          </th>
                                        </tr>
                                      </tbody>
                                    </table>
                                  </th>
                                </tr>
                              </table>
                            </th>
                          </tr>
                        </tbody>
                      </table><!-- END HEADER --> <!-- START ACCOUNT INFO --><table role="presentation" align="left" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="100%">
                        <tbody>
                          <tr>
                            <th class="small-12 columns" style="padding-left:80px;padding-right:80px;padding-top:48px;width:510px;">
                              <table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="collapse" valign="top" width="100%">
                                <tbody>
                                  <tr>
                                    <th class="small-12 columns" style="text-align:left;width:255px">
                                     <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:0px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">이름: {!Contact.FirstName}</p>
                                      <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:0px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">성: {!Contact.LastName}</p>
                                      <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:0px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">사용자 이름(이메일 주소):  {!Contact.Email}</p>
                                    </th>

                                  </tr>
                                </tbody>
                              </table><br></th>
                          </tr>
                        </tbody>
                      </table><!-- END ACCOUNT INFO --> <!-- START LEFT ALIGNED CONTENT --><table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%">
                        <tbody>
                          <tr>
                            <th class="small-12 columns" style="padding-left:80px;padding-right:80px;padding-bottom:24px;width:510px;">
                              <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:20px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">인텔 기밀 리소스와 보안 콘텐츠에 액세스할 수 있는 Developer Zone Premier 자격이 인텔&reg; 파트너 얼라이언스의 혜택으로 제공됩니다. 소중한 Developer Zone Premier 사용자로서 인텔&reg; 파트너 얼라이언스 프로그램에 즉시 가입할 수 있습니다.</p>

                              <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:20px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">귀하의 회사는 이미 인텔® 파트너 얼라이언스의 귀중한 회원입니다. 이미 프로그램에 참여 중인 동료들과 함께 높은 가치의 [독점=> 특별한] 혜택에 액세스할 수 있는 기회입니다. 몇 가지 예는 다음과 같습니다.</p>


                              <ul style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">
                                <li style="list-style:disc outside; mso-special-format:bullet;margin-bottom:20px;"><strong>인텔&reg; 파트너 유니버시티</strong>를 통해 800개가 넘는 세계적 수준의 교육 과정과 30개 이상의 역량 및 인증, 업계 인사이트, 비즈니스 전망 등 중요 지식에 액세스할 수 있습니다.</li>
                                <li style="list-style:disc outside; mso-special-format:bullet;margin-bottom:20px;">해당 인텔제품 구매와 비지니스 구축 활동을 통해 포인트를 적립할 수 있습니다. 비지니스에 가치있는 사용을 위해 포인트를 교환하실 수 있습니다. </li>
                                <li style="list-style:disc outside; mso-special-format:bullet;margin-bottom:20px;">인텔&reg; 기술 기반의 제품 및 솔루션을 구축, 마케팅, 판매하는 데 필요한 리소스를 제공하는 선별된 산업 주제 및 작업 중심의 <strong>활성화 존</strong>에 액세스할 수 있습니다.</li>
                                <li style="list-style:disc outside; mso-special-format:bullet;margin-bottom:20px;">개인화된 상점을 통해 <strong>인텔&reg; Partner Showcase</strong>에서 솔루션을 홍보하여 생태계 전반에서 수천 명의 파트너 및 최종 고객과 연결할 수 있습니다.</li>
                              </ul>

                              <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:20px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">지금 담당자로 가입하면 귀사에 100포인트*가 적립되며, 인텔&reg; 파트너 얼라이언스와 Developer Zone Premier가 제공하는 모든 것을 경험할 수 있습니다.</p>
                              <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:18px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:20px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">빠르고 쉬운 다음 단계를 따르십시오.</p>

                    <ol style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">
                                <li style="margin-bottom:20px;"><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/kr/ko/secure/forms/ipa-secondary.html" target="_blank" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:20px;margin:0;text-align:center;text-decoration:underline;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">지금 가입</a>을 클릭하고 프롬프트**를 따라 본인을 회사 계정에 연결합니다.</li>
                                <li style="margin-bottom:20px;">확인 절차가 완료되면 인텔&reg; 파트너 얼라이언스에 로그인하라는 이메일을 받게 됩니다.</li>

                              </ol>
                               <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:20px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">프로그램이 제공하는 모든 혜택을 알아보고 지금 인텔&reg; 파트너 얼라이언스에 가입하십시오.</p>
                            <table role="presentation" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" valign="top" width="100%">
                                <tbody>
                                  <tr>
                                    <th style="padding-top:32px;"><!-- START BUTTON --><table role="presentation" align="left" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="auto">
																			 <tbody>
																				 <tr>
																					 <th style="background:#00C7FD ;padding:10px 24px 10px 24px;"><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/kr/ko/secure/forms/ipa-secondary.html" target="_blank" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#262626;display:block;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:20px;margin:0;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">지금 가입<img src="https://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{3c6395e2-a99d-4d56-af68-36b36f3ef629}_arrow_email_black.png" valign="middle" alt=""></a></th>
																				 </tr>
																			 </tbody>
																		 </table><!-- END BUTTON --></th>
																 </tr>
															 </tbody>
														 </table><br><p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-top:32px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">가입하여 파트너가 되는 데 도움이 필요하십니까? <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/kr/ko/support.html?elqTrackId=e8aebb5fa57546dab808d4902c25087c&elqTrack=true" target="_blank" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:20px;margin:0;text-align:center;text-decoration:underline;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">지원팀에 문의하십시오</a>.</p><br><p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:12px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">*요건을 충족하는 경우 제공되는 포인트입니다. 자격 요구 사항을 참조하십시오.</p>

							 <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:12px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin-top:20px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none"><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/kr/ko/support/articles/000092340/programs/access-entitlement-for-myintel-users.html?wapkw=azure%20mfa%20help&elqTrackId=0f654af1184b4c4a9c97cb0ecda4c3c0&elqTrack=true" target="_blank" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Malgun Gothic','Dotum','Verdana','Tahoma','Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:12px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:20px;margin:0;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">*<u>Azure 다중 인증(MFA) 도움말</u></a></p>
													 </th>
												 </tr>
											 </tbody>
										 </table><!-- END LEFT ALIGNED CONTENT --> <!-- START IPA SOCIAL RIBBON - UPDATE THE BACKGROUND COLOR ON THE BLADE BY CHANGING THIS TABLE BACKGROUND --><table role="presentation" align="center" bgcolor="#0095CA" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%">
                           <tbody>
                             <tr>
                               <th>
                                 <table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" valign="middle" width="100%">
                                   <tbody>
